id: emlib_opamp
label: OPAMP
package: platform_core
description: >
  Operational Amplifier (OPAMP) peripheral API. Deprecated: Series 2 VDAC has
  no op-amps, so this component provides no API on supported devices. It will
  be removed in a future release.
category: Platform|Peripheral|EMLIB
quality: deprecated
ui_hints:
